      en: ["The national park was officially created on July 28, 1999.", "Lake Naroch is the largest water body in the park, covering 79.6 km².", "About 17% of all Belarusian plant species can be found in the park.", "More than 40 lakes of glacial origin are located within the park limits.", "The area is home to 18 major sanatoriums and health resorts.", "A total of 218 bird species have been recorded within the park's territory."],
